{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026iRtIZmzh5g1792721795.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價上升。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價報6.7165，較上個交易日上調6點子。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價和離岸價早段都於6.66水平上落。</p><p></p><p>另外，人民銀行開展1,510億元人民幣7天期逆回購操作及1萬億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作。扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨投放1,510億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:01:24.206220+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T02:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T12:38:20.573688+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T02:58:18.050649+00:00","content_hash":"781af8b3340e02ce2a1bc33d61323a91aa21d7b2dc5a05b5366514e15a2ad242","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:01:24.206220+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}